### Register a new user
POST https://localhost:7213/api/Users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "student01",
    "password": "Student@123"
}
### Login existing user
POST https://localhost:7213/api/Users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "student01",
    "password": "Student@123"
}
### Login with incorrect password
POST https://localhost:7213/api/Users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "student01",
    "password": "WrongPassword123"
}
### Change Password
POST https://localhost:7213/api/Users/change-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "student01",
    "oldPassword": "Student@123",
    "newPassword": "NewStudent@123"
}
### Login with new password
POST https://localhost:7213/api/Users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "student01",
    "password": "NewStudent@123"
}